Package: imx477-rpi-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, device-tree-compiler
Recommends: linux-headers-rpi-2712 | linux-headers-rpi-v8
Description: Sony IMX477 camera driver for Raspberry Pi (DKMS)
 Kernel module and device tree overlay for Sony IMX477, a 12.3 MP
 stacked CMOS sensor, on Raspberry Pi with kernel 6.12 or newer.
 Drop-in replacement for in-kernel imx477 driver, adding 4-lane MIPI
 CSI-2 and configurable link frequency. Works with Raspberry Pi HQ
 Camera and other IMX477 modules.
 .
 DKMS builds the module on target, so one package covers every Raspberry Pi
 OS release and kernel update. Installing it also places its device tree
 overlay in /boot/overlays.
